{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/wish2.png?t=1745483222\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crime Detective</strong> is a game series inspired by real criminal cases. Each installment offers a standalone story where the player finds themselves at the heart of dark events, facing mysteries, dangers, and shocking revelations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/extras/MAINGIF.gif?t=1745483222\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Crime Detective: Red Flags</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first episode of Crime Detective, you play as Cody Harper, a student placed under house arrest in suburban America during the 1980s. To keep busy, Cody\u2019s father suggests he earn some extra money by helping neighbors with small errands. The days pass uneventfully \u2014 but in the evenings, out of boredom, Cody starts observing the lives of his neighbors. What began as innocent curiosity soon turns into something far more sinister.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is an atmospheric first-person simulator focused on exploration, item interaction, and character communication.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Voice interaction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Photorealistic graphics and atmospheric environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spatial audio.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A story inspired by a real serial killer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3528280?t=1745483222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3528280/cf85fad6d46d14ddf3b5330d113f55c20e6fe7c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745483222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst